Library           com.nokia.validationsuite.ne3s.soap.api.VSAPI
Library           com.nokia.validationsuite.ne3s.soap.api.CNUMAPI
Library           com.nokia.validationsuite.ne3s.soap.api.CNUMAPIWithTestSuiteScope
Library           com.nokia.vtk.robot.api.VTKAPI
Library           com.nokia.validationsuite.ne3s.soap.api.RegistrationConfiguration
Library           Process
Library           OperatingSystem
Library           XML
Suite Setup        Run Process    /home/ute/ValidationToolKit_21.12/NE3S_VTK/webservice/Tomcat.sh -restart    shell=True    timeout=10
Suite Teardown     Run Process    /home/ute/ValidationToolKit_21.12/NE3S_VTK/webservice/Tomcat.sh -stop    shell=True    timeout=10

*** Variables ***
${S_NE3S_PATH}    /home/ute/ValidationToolKit_21.12/NE3S_VTK/webservice

*** Test Cases ***
Register
    [Setup]
    Clear VTKResultFileList
    Set Manager Vendor    Nokia
    Send Start Registration Request    ${TRUE}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    Send Complete Registration Request
    Send Unregistration Request
    Set Manager Vendor    NSN
    Send Start Registration Request    ${TRUE}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    Send Complete Registration Request
    Send Unregistration Request
    Set Manager Vendor    Nokia Siemens Networks
    Send Start Registration Request    ${TRUE}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    Send Complete Registration Request
    [Teardown]    VTK Teardown

Wrong Vendor
    [Setup]
    Clear VTKResultFileList
    Set Manager Vendor    nokia
    ${status}    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    Send Start Registration Request    ${TRUE}
    Should Contain    ${status[1]}    Illegal operation arguments
    [Teardown]    VTK Teardown

UnRegister
    [Setup]    VTK Setup
    Send Unregistration Request
    [Teardown]    VTK Teardown

Ping
    [Setup]    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    VTK Setup
    Send Ping Request
    [Teardown]    VTK Teardown

*** Keywords ***
VTK Setup
    Clear VTKResultFileList
    Set Manager Vendor    Nokia
    Send Start Registration Request    ${TRUE}
    Send Complete Registration Request

VTK Teardown
    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    Send Stop Session Request
    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    Send Unregistration Request